flowchart LR
  Q[Question] --> R[TF-IDF retriever<br/>top-3 passages]
  R --> C[Context sentences]
  A[Generated answer] --> S[Split into claims]
  S --> E[Best evidence sentence<br/>per claim]
  C --> E
  E --> J{Judge}
  J -->|similar; numbers agree;<br/>no flip; no substitution| SUP[Supported]
  J -->|number conflict, polarity flip<br/>or word substitution| CON[Contradicted]
  J -->|no sufficiently<br/>similar evidence| UNS[Unsupported]
